# Small Web

A full-stack small-web browser application.

## Technology Stack

- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- NestJS
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

## Features

- Browse published websites
- Address bar navigation
- Back and Forward
- Browsing history
- Full-text search
- Website publishing
- Secure HTML rendering

## Development

Frontend and backend are maintained separately.
MongoDB runs locally without Docker.